;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="894" width="900" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c54" value="v3 → v4" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="944" width="120" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c55" value="CSP: one learned vector per crop and per disease" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="160" y="944" width="380" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c56" value="+24.7" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="944" width="80" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c57" value="–" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="944" width="190" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c58" value="The model learns diseases at all (closed seen 8 → 52, AUSUC +35). Biggest step by far." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="944" width="900" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c59" value="v4 → v5.5" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="994" width="120" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c60" value="Bigger LoRA (through v4.1, v4.2, v5)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="160" y="994" width="380" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c61" value="+5.4 ⚠" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="994" width="80" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c62" value="10.9 → 9.2 (down)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="994" width="190" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c63" value="Test only: on validation γ0 fell. Smaller seen-vs-unseen offset on test (bias gap 0.027 → 0.019), not better recognition (AUSUC +0.6)." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="994" width="900" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c64" value="v5.5 → v11.3" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1044" width="120" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c65" value="GAN classifier with generated unseen features, on v10.3's LoRA features" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="160" y="1044" width="380" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c66" value="+3.7" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="1044" width="80" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c67" value="15.3 → 28.6 (best so far, +13.3)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="1044" width="190" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c68" value="Training on 300 fake features per unseen pair removes most of the lean toward seen pairs. The only step validation also backs." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="1044" width="900" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c69" value="&lt;b&gt;Steps v11.3 inherits that did not raise HM at γ = 0&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;v4.1 / v4.2&lt;/b&gt; (γ and validation fixes): −8.8 / −0.1. They change how γ is chosen, which γ = 0 ignores; v4.1's later epoch is more seen-biased.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;v5 LoRA&lt;/b&gt;: +0.1 test, −1.5 val (split 42). The biggest recognition gain after CSP (AUSUC +17) is invisible at γ = 0 because seen bias grew with it.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;v10.3 text anchor&lt;/b&gt;: −6.3 test, +0.5 val. Needed only as the source of v11.3's image features.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;v11 alone&lt;/b&gt; (GAN on frozen CLIP): 24.2, below v4 at 34.9; it needs the LoRA features." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1134" width="820" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c70" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read the walk-up&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• HM at γ = 0 mostly measures how seen-biased a model is, not how well it recognises leaves. So the walk-up rewards steps that shrink the bias (descriptions, generated unseen features) and misses big recognition gains (LoRA).&lt;br&gt;• By validation alone (available from v4.2), there is a single step: v4.2 (15.3) → v11.3 (28.6). That is the uncalibrated ladder.&lt;br&gt;• ⚠ v4 → v5.5 rises on test only; validation went down. Treat it as inherited, not as evidence.&lt;br&gt;• Orange = the GAN branch (v11, its no-generation ablation v11.2 at 0.0)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#fff0f0;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="1134" width="860" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>